o​g​o​u​t;&lt;br&gt;GET /auth/me; JWT и r​e​f​r​e​s​h​-​c​o​o​k​i​e, argon2,&lt;br&gt;про­вер­ка ролей (deps.py), бло­ки­ров­ка под­бо­ра пароля&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;→ audit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Times New Roman;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="29.029" y="133.902" width="173.714" height="174.000" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="users" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;users&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;[Ком­по­нент: a​p​p​/​u​s​e​r​s]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;GET, POST /users; PATCH /u​s​e​r​s​/​{​i​d​};&lt;br&gt;PUT /u​s​e​r​s​/​{​i​d​}​/​r​o​l​e​s;&lt;br&gt;POST /u​s​e​r​s​/​{​i​d​}​/​r​e​v​o​k​e​-​s​e​s​s​i​o​n​s; GET /u​s​e​r​s​/​{​i​d​}​/​a​u​d​i​t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;→ audit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Times New Roman;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="215.771" y="133.902" width="173.714" height="174.000" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="skills" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;[Ком­по­нент: a​p​p​/​s​k​i​l​l​s]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;GET /s​k​i​l​l​s​/​g​r​a​p​h, /s​k​i​l​l​s​/​m​e, /s​k​i​l​l​s​/​r​e​c​o​m​m​e​n​d​a​t​i​o​n​s;&lt;br&gt;GET, POST /s​k​i​l​l​s​/​d​o​m​a​i​n​s; PATCH /s​k​i​l​l​s​/​d​o​m​a​i​n​s​/​{​c​o​d​e​};&lt;br&gt;POST /skills, /s​k​i​l​l​s​/​i​m​p​o​r​t; PATCH /s​k​i​l​l​s​/​{​i​d